  Run this command:                                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                        
     .venv/bin/python -m smvd                                                                                                                                           
                                                                                                                                                                        
     The app will start at http://127.0.0.1:8653 and open your browser automatically.                                                                                   
                                                                                                                                                                        
     Optional flags:                                                                                                                                                    
                                                                                                                                                                        
     - --no-browser — don't auto-open the browser                                                                                                                       
     - --port N — use a specific port 
